# Pairs with ModeReResolvedLocally. An enrolled tree's run is applied under
# the merge mode the wire carries rather than the locally resolved one.
MODULE: ReceiverTrustsWireMode
TARGET: ModeReResolvedLocally
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the wire mode decides whether an enrolled tree's run applies
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
ELSE IF Admits(mode, cls) THEN "applied"
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF cls \in Modes THEN "applied"
--- END